Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:07.84,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:13.54,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:19.24,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:25.64,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:31.46,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:37.20,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:48.40,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:01:00.76,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now. Spirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:06.20,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:12.52,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.54,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:24.00,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:29.40,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.71,0:02:12.90,GREEN,,0,0,850,,{\i1}Thank you for giving me a heart.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:13.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.83,0:02:17.93,Default,,500,0,500,,The \N Fortunate\N Ones
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.69,0:02:22.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.47,0:02:24.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.07,0:02:26.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.07,0:02:31.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You don't usually call me at this time of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.57,0:02:36.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You shouldn't talk...\NYou never hang out with us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:40.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.63,0:02:43.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mmm, something is bothering me a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.13,0:02:47.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That girl over there got a\Nheart transplant last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.43,0:02:51.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Her parents were overjoyed that\Na compatible heart was found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.55,0:02:59.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They apparently wanted to\Nthank the donor in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:02.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems like a happy story to this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.85,0:03:04.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.05,0:03:08.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The heart donor is a boy that is under my care;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.45,0:03:12.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,he had to replace some parts of his body\Nwith cybernetic implants for treatment,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.95,0:03:16.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and he got a cybernetic heart, since the implants\Nwould have overburdened his biological heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:21.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but his parents are saying that they\Ndon't remember donating the organ at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.55,0:03:25.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They could be compulsive liars, or just shy;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:28.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,there could be errors in\Ncoordinating the transplant,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.35,0:03:30.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,or post-factum memory confusion...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:33.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Any other possible aftereffects?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.35,0:03:37.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The boy's mother apparently\Nwent to consult the police,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:40.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but the detective in charge got into an accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:41.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so the investigation is currently stalled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.55,0:03:45.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't know if this is your territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:48.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but... it just bothers me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.19,0:03:52.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The surgery was necessitated by a\Nsudden accident and had to be rushed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.89,0:03:56.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and it seems that they were prepared to give her a full\Ncybernetic body if an organ hadn't become available.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.99,0:03:59.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Since she is so young,\Nshe would have had to periodically switch to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:01.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,new cybernetic bodies as she aged,\Nwhich would have been stressful,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.74,0:04:06.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,not to mention all the costs and maintenance\Nit would have involved; she was quite lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:12.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How old is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:16.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She is still only six years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.53,0:04:35.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, the information wasn't anything significant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.63,0:04:38.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What now? Should we just go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.53,0:04:43.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Go to the company that supposedly\Ncoordinated her transplant, Meditech.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.23,0:04:48.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll have Ishikawa and Boma check\Nthe cash flow before they join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:50.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Something on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.53,0:04:56.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You know that there have been mass abductions\Nhere involving overseas mafias recently, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.53,0:05:01.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Those involved in the black market trade\Nof organs and cybernetic devices, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:05.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's possible that domestic channels\Naiding the smugglers are involved in this case too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:08.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I want to investigate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.23,0:05:10.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.13,0:05:11.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.55,0:05:44.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry to have kept you waiting;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:48.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,allow me to introduce the CEO of\NMeditech, Mr. Iwasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.25,0:05:51.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's nice to meet you.\NI'm Togusa from Public Safety's Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.37,0:05:56.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, I'm a secretary android; Mr. Iwasaki is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.77,0:06:01.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:03.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, please, don't feel bad about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.07,0:06:05.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It happens all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.87,0:06:09.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,People just don't seem to recognise\NJameson type cyborgs for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.77,0:06:14.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,My kids always scold me about having\Na bad taste in cyborg bodies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:19.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Still, it's about my principles,\Nand they cannot be compromised, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.27,0:06:24.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, oops... sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.47,0:06:27.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, I heard you wanted to confirm something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.29,0:06:31.69,RED,,0,500,850,,JAPAN'S #1
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.37,0:06:28.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:29.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.65,0:06:32.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:37.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:41.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hmm, it is indeed our invoice slip...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.96,0:06:43.00,BLACK,,0,1200,850,,Niihama General Hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:43.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, strangely...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.54,0:06:48.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Coordinating transplants is not\None of our company's services.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:54.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, if you want to look over anything, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:07:00.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If I remember correctly,\Nyour company advertises for people to register
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.22,0:07:02.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,their genomes with you so that spare\Norgans can be manufactured on demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.03,0:07:03.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.93,0:07:06.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We splice our customer's\Ngenetic information into pigs
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:08.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and "grow" the desired organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.72,0:07:12.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When required,\Nwe can extract the organ and deliver it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.92,0:07:14.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is it lucrative?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.82,0:07:17.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why are you asking? Of course it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:20.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You should register your genome\Nand reserve an organ pig, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:24.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Our basic plan includes registration\Nfor five different organs;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:26.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,if you sign up now, I'll give you a special deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.22,0:07:29.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Make your pitch to him; his body is still flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:31.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, I'm not particularly....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.52,0:07:32.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, what a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:35.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you don't require the organs\Nduring the pig's lifetime,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:38.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,just sell them to existing\Ntransplant coordination companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.12,0:07:40.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you're going to invest in this field,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:43.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,invest in Meditech!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:47.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And while we're talking about investing, there's\Nno reason Ms Cyborg here shouldn't invest as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:55.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well then, do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.56,0:07:58.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If there are any questions, please call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.86,0:08:00.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.66,0:08:06.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I guess he's the folksy type that you'll\Nfind no matter what era you live in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:09.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You mean to say that he's\Nthe "Osaka Merchant" type?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.36,0:08:11.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What a stereotype.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.96,0:08:15.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's taking pains to speak in a bad Kansai\Ndialect to present himself that way, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.46,0:08:20.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Still, to think that the CEO of the largest\Ncompany in the artificial organ industry
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.26,0:08:24.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is a cyborg that's using a Jameson-type body...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:28.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Considering his enthusiasm,\NI wonder if he sold his own organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.46,0:08:31.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And that's why he's in that box?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.96,0:08:34.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's not too far-fetched of an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.36,0:08:34.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:37.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're here to take over...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.56,0:08:39.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.76,0:08:42.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We found something when we\Nlooked into the cash flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:48.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,An amount of money from the Crime Victim's\NCompensation Fund is being paid to this company.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.66,0:08:50.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.86,0:08:52.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, there is no record\Nof the transaction here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:55.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and there is no corresponding evidence in either\Nits communications or operational records.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:57.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Falsification of data from the outside, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:08:59.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's probably it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:01.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even though Meditech's a huge company,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.65,0:09:04.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,their internal data is so badly protected\Nit can leak like water through a sieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.12,0:09:11.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa, let's go see the hospitalized\Ndetective in charge of the investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.64,0:09:14.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do a good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.52,0:09:22.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I believe it happened last weekend...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:25.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He collapsed while conducting an\Ninvestigation; the hospitalization was sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:29.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Test results came up positive for drugs,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.82,0:09:32.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and while faint,\Nthere are also signs of memory confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:33.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.49,0:09:37.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.45,0:09:43.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.05,0:09:46.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it, they got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.70,0:10:04.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:05.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Get in and be quick about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:06.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:07.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll hear your excuses later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.47,0:10:12.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma, you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.87,0:10:14.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,On the hospital rooftop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.37,0:10:16.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.87,0:10:24.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:26.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was starting to get worried because\Nyou guys were late coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.07,0:10:28.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.47,0:10:32.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was because you got greedy in the\Nfirst place that we forgot to switch a label!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.17,0:10:36.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We erased that detective's memory,\Nso we're fine now, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.97,0:10:39.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In any case, I wonder who that guy was just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.17,0:10:41.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.67,0:10:43.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His co-worker or something, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.27,0:10:46.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma, do you think you\Ncan overtake the vehicle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.77,0:10:51.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can get onto it,\Nbut that'd be pretty noticeable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.18,0:10:55.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Keep following us from above;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.18,0:10:56.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,confirm the vehicle's licence plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:10:57.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.68,0:11:01.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa, stay on standby and keep monitoring\Nthe Omni-directional wireless com system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.08,0:11:04.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're going to scatter a probe virus,\Nso you can determine the echo factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.88,0:11:05.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:08.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wouldn't that violate the\NRadio Communications Law?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:10.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's what we call a localized state of emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.28,0:11:11.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.14,0:11:27.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When we exit this tunnel,\Nwe can transmit the virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.94,0:11:34.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Transmission standby, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:35.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.67,0:11:44.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:49.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Determined the escaping vehicle;
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:50.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,also confirmed its registered user.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.47,0:11:54.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems that the fugitive is\Na medical student in residency.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.47,0:11:56.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.77,0:12:00.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They intend to go to the port's\Nwarehouse district and to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.97,0:12:03.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's about time to call Batou.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.70,0:12:09.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Continue to chase the escaping vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:11.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will meet up with Batou in the Tachikoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:12.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.38,0:12:28.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We took it too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:30.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Doing more would be too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:32.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's hurry up and toss these out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.78,0:12:35.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We were only providing organs at cut-throat prices
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.18,0:12:39.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,to citizens who couldn't get cybernetic\Nimplants for various reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:43.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Besides, even if we get caught,\Nmy dad will take care of it, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.18,0:12:47.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Still, for now, what should we do with these?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.88,0:12:52.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We'll hide them, along with the\Ncar, until the dust settles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.28,0:12:55.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are tons of warehouses\Nand junkyards up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.58,0:13:00.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No one will notice one car abandoned there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.28,0:13:01.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm worried about that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:03.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He suddenly shot at us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.58,0:13:08.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What if he's one of the overseas mafia\Nwho've been conducting mass abductions?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:10.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.88,0:13:12.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.78,0:13:14.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's because we moved in on their territory!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.78,0:13:18.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If they catch us, won't hey hack\Nus apart and sell the parts?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.68,0:13:20.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,if they're the mafia, they'll do it...\NWe're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.58,0:13:22.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're in big trouble...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:22.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, shut up for a second, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.60,0:13:27.40,BLACK,,0,0,250,,TRANSMISSION \N BLOCKED
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.47,0:13:31.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, it IS true!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:37.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We might... really be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.54,0:13:44.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:47.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can also see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.81,0:13:50.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm waiting at the rendezvous, as ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.51,0:13:53.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're going to corner the\Nsubject vehicle at point D-3.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.41,0:13:55.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Feel free to terrorise them, without killing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:58.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey hey, are you sure we\Ncan do something that fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.97,0:13:59.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.97,0:14:02.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ha, that's the way things should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.97,0:14:03.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.47,0:14:04.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All righty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:25.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, that's the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:27.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't hit anyone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.06,0:14:29.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:42.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.10,0:14:44.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hurry up and get out of the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.90,0:14:45.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're going to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:48.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oooh, they're putting up a good fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:56.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, now for the second round.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.24,0:14:57.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well then, without restraint...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.79,0:15:05.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yo! I put on a real show for them, just like you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.62,0:15:09.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.25,0:15:16.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,H, hey... isn't this going a bit far?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.66,0:15:24.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,P, please forgive us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.86,0:15:27.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As we thought, a med student, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.57,0:15:27.57,Default,,0,850,850,,Student ID
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.57,0:15:27.57,Default,,0,500,250,,Class of '32
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.57,0:15:27.57,Default,,150,0,950,,Niihama Dental School
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.57,0:15:27.57,Default,,1000,0,700,,Medical Nanotechnology \N Manufacturing Department
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.06,0:15:32.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It makes me depressed to think that guys like\Nthese could be messing around inside my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:34.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou-San!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:37.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Look at what I found!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.20,0:15:40.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To sum up the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.40,0:15:45.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You were changing labels, without permission, and extracted\Norgans that had been exchanged with cybernetic implants,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:47.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and were selling them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:49.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There should be one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:51.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh? He's a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.50,0:15:52.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:52.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.90,0:15:55.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.70,0:15:57.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The scam seems too vicious for something that\Nwas just supposed to earn them pocket money.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:16:01.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This affair will only be swept under\Nthe rug if we let the law deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.20,0:16:05.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll go give him a good "lesson".
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.76,0:16:12.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wooo, scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.06,0:16:14.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.76,0:16:15.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.12,0:16:20.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.82,0:16:23.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You guys will be dealt with by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:27.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hhhhhelp us, pplease ddon't take our organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.62,0:16:28.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.02,0:16:32.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sure anyone who sees your face\Nwould think that you're in the mafia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:36.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,H, hey! Me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.35,0:16:46.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wh, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.55,0:16:53.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wh, what the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.65,0:17:01.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:43.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,From what I see, you have no cybernetic implants.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.52,0:17:48.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sure you'd fetch a high price if I\Nsold you piecemeal on the black market.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:55.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,H, hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.32,0:17:56.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have good connections!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.12,0:18:00.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's good business, want to team up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.42,0:18:03.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If I ask my dad,\Nwe can have cars and warehouses, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:05.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We wouldn't have trouble getting funds, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.72,0:18:07.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's not a bad deal, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:11.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you think we'd negotiate with peons like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.02,0:18:16.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We'll take your connections and\Nsilence you for the hell of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:20.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If we spread your organs around on the market, there\Nwill be no evidence and we'd also make a profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.02,0:18:22.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We'll kill two birds with one stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.82,0:18:24.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,W, wait, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.82,0:18:27.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,O, ok, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.72,0:18:29.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is it money?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:32.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If it's about money,\Nmy dad will give you however much you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.72,0:18:35.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,R, right? How much do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.02,0:18:37.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Your game has gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:41.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You've stuck your neck out in a\Nworld where there's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.32,0:18:44.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,P, please, forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:45.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I won't do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:47.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I beg of you! I won't do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.32,0:18:49.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:50.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:07.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They won't let you off this easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:20.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are many in the underground who\Nhave no interest in listening to reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.66,0:19:23.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Clean up your act while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.16,0:19:26.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You have money and schooling;
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:28.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,you're healthy on top of that, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:37.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major! I can't... get... out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.79,0:19:42.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We'll come pick you up later; stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:45.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're going to hand these guys over to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.09,0:19:47.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.42,0:20:01.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, it's Batou-San!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.52,0:20:03.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, hey man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.92,0:20:07.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, wasn't the Major a bit strange today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.34,0:20:14.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Uh, well, the Major seemed a\Nbit different today, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:20.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well. the Major became a complete cyborg\Nwhen she was around that girl's age.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.14,0:20:24.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sure she had some issues with this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.24,0:20:26.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.34,0:20:28.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Still have something on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:30.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, nothing really.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.24,0:20:35.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just thinking that, in this world,\Nthere are those, like that girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.21,0:20:38.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,who have no choice but\Nto undergo an organ transplant,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:42.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,as well as those like that CEO who voluntarily\Nsell their organs to become a cyborg.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:46.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And between those two types,\Nthe organ transplant business flourishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.60,0:20:50.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All natural bodies bring a premium,\Nand this country's economy keeps rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.60,0:20:55.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Only those who benefit from being in an environment in\N where they are free from religious and economic constraints
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:58.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,can obtain high-quality cybernetic implants;
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.10,0:21:01.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,like Section 9, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.52,0:21:04.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:07.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Does your soft heart ache because you feel\Nlike you're on the side of the exploiters?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.42,0:21:09.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.64,0:21:14.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just... I was wondering which type\Nof decision it was for the Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:20.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Checkmate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.71,0:21:23.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What? That's a different game!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.44,0:21:27.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.64,0:21:29.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, you bought another piece\Nof body building equipment?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.37,0:21:32.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't care what you buy with your salary,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.57,0:21:34.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but I can't approve of your consumer habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:35.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's your problem¡?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.17,0:21:38.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why don't you stop pretending\Nto be a woman on the surface
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.97,0:21:41.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and switch to a male cyborg body yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.87,0:21:43.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You'll get more power that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:51.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.37,0:22:04.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.88,0:22:12.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If I can take  the power\Nof my adversary  and use it against him,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.68,0:22:15.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,there's no disadvantage to\Nhaving a female body, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.88,0:22:19.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm expecting a good read\Nfrom the report you'll draw up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.59,0:22:21.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,making full use of your brain "muscle".
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.90,0:22:27.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You okay there, Batou?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.10,0:22:30.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Doesn't hurt at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.75,0:23:19.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.65,0:23:23.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.63,0:23:27.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:30.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:35.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.40,0:23:39.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.73,0:23:42.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.70,0:23:47.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.85,0:23:50.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.54,0:23:55.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.94,0:24:00.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.14,0:24:00.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.84,0:24:03.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.24,0:24:05.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.81,0:24:07.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.81,0:24:10.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.12,0:24:14.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
